---
description: |
  Emits the SOC Prime Active Threats of the bundled detection content.

  Every event is one Active Threat in the shape of the SOC Prime TDM API, with
  the TDM `id`, the threat `name`, `summary`, `severity`, the investigation,
  response, and mitigation guidance, and its classification by industry,
  geography, threat type, threat actor, and ATT&CK technique.
  `high_order_sigma_rules` lists the High-Order Sigma rules of the threat and
  `rules` all of its Sigma rules, both by Sigma rule ID and name. Use
  `socprime::ocsf::map` to translate the threats to OCSF.
---

from {threats: socprime::$active_threats}
unroll threats
this = threats
